      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING MILANO (1) tends to take a while to wind up, missing the placings two back but running on to last time finishing third (30.21) in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park. Has a good record at this journey. Can find winning form. CASH KEEPING (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and four minors from nine tries. Was out of the placings last time (29.77) at The Gardens in a NG, finishing fifth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks one of the chances. GRAVEL DUST (7) showed good early speed and led throughout to score at big odds last time when a 6 length winner at this track over 401m (22.84). Solid record at the distance winning two races. One of the prime contenders. TARAWI SUSHI (5) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
